  "question": "What fast food restaurant are positioned within 70 kilometers when heading north from Adventure Park, Scottsdale, AZ?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS  (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-111.890218 33.543572)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois, origin\nWHERE ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-111.890218 33.543572)',4326)::geography, 70000)\nAND amenity = 'fast_food'\nAND ((degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 0.0 AND 22.5) OR (degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 337.5 AND 360));\n",
